# Real trace — H7 self-seat full-spectrum board (ELIM-SELF-FIX §29.95, RNB-1 R4 重锚 §29.90, RNB-5B 微席折叠 §29.99⑦; SEAL-1)
#
# Golden sample donghu.ftrace, window 13762.791708..13763.024898 (233.190ms),
