#     keeps small on-chain seats in detail and must disclose a non-zero `未入榜
#     ⛓ N 行` plus the reader-facing `枚举未完整`; a bounded view must not
#     impersonate exhaustive enumeration. The wire value remains available in
#     typed diagnostics but must not leak into the customer-facing answer. The
#     question's small contributors remain available to the model and evidence
#     index without pinning a stale presentation grouping.
# SOFT oracle (verdict-judged):
#   · the fold row keeps credential semantics (仍属⛓链上通道 family wording)
